{
  "total_duration": 642.953,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.32,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "如果没有手机，也没有网络，你怎么知道现在几点？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 4.67,
      "end": 9.07,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "以前很多人会看城市里的大钟，或者听广播里的报时。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 9.42,
      "end": 18.692,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Big Ben"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就是这样的钟：它不只是被人看见，还能通过"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "B.B.C."
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "被全世界听见。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 19.041,
      "end": 24.681,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是这么著名、这么准确的大钟，也曾经被一个小小的油漆桶拖慢。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 25.031,
      "end": 29.391,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天我们学一个关于公共时间、准确性和小反转的故事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 29.741,
      "end": 34.537,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧，先把"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Big Ben"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "看成公共时间。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 34.887,
      "end": 44.207,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：到伦敦时，最先看到的地标之一就是这座著名大钟，它的钟声还能通过广播传到远处。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 44.557,
      "end": 50.033,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "When you visit London, one of the first things you will see is Big Ben"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 50.382,
      "end": 56.142,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "后面补充："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "the famous clock which can be heard all over the world on the B.B.C."
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 56.492,
      "end": 62.932,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "注意它的 fame 不只是视觉，也有声音：人们看见钟塔，也听见钟声。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 63.282,
      "end": 70.75,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "one of the first things you will see"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，还有"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "heard all over the world"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 71.1,
      "end": 74.64,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧，故事回到一场大火和一座新建筑。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 74.99,
      "end": 81.27,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：如果国会大厦没有在 1834 年被烧毁，这座大钟就不会被建起来。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 81.62,
      "end": 89.783,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "If the Houses of Parliament had not been burned down in 1834, the great clock would never have been erected"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 90.133,
      "end": 94.213,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这不是讲未来，而是在想象一个相反的过去。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 94.563,
      "end": 99.571,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "然后课文说"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Big Ben takes its name from Sir Benjamin Hall"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 99.921,
      "end": 105.689,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "他在新国会大厦建造时"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "was responsible for the making of the clock"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 106.039,
      "end": 110.279,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧，大钟变成可信的公共时间系统。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 110.629,
      "end": 120.469,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：它不仅巨大，而且很准确；Greenwich 的官员每天两次安排检查，麦克风把钟声传给 BBC。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 120.819,
      "end": 126.582,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It is not only of immense size, but is extremely accurate as well"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 126.932,
      "end": 133.46,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Immense"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是非常巨大，"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "accurate"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是准确。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 133.81,
      "end": 140.234,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "然后是关键结构："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Officials from Greenwich Observatory have the clock checked twice a day"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 140.584,
      "end": 147.36,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Have the clock checked"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是安排别人检查，不一定是官员亲自爬上去检查。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 147.71,
      "end": 153.645,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "麦克风连到钟塔，所以人们能在"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "B.B.C."
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "上听到它打点。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 153.995,
      "end": 157.635,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧，宏大的系统被一个小东西拖慢。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 157.985,
      "end": 166.665,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Big Ben 很少出错，可有一次没有报准时间，因为油漆工把一桶油漆挂在了一根指针上。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 167.015,
      "end": 171.207,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文先说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Big Ben has rarely gone wrong"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 171.557,
      "end": 176.725,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Rarely"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是很少，所以这里一定不是“很多出差错”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 177.075,
      "end": 182.33,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "反转来了："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Once, however, it failed to give the correct time"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 182.68,
      "end": 189.36,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "原因很小也很形象："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A painter hung a pot of paint on one of the hands and slowed it down"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 189.71,
      "end": 197.658,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "hands"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是钟表指针，不是人的手。一个油漆桶，就让著名大钟慢了下来。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 198.008,
      "end": 204.444,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，为什么一个钟会这么有名？现在每个人手机上都有时间呀。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 204.794,
      "end": 214.394,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "正因为现在太方便，我们才容易忘记以前的 public time。没有智能手机时，一座城市要有大家都信的时间。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 214.744,
      "end": 219.15,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Big Ben"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不只是旅游照片？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 219.499,
      "end": 227.019,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。它是地标，也是声音。人们看见钟塔，听见钟声，就觉得这个时间是共同的、可信的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 227.369,
      "end": 232.345,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Big Ben"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "到底是钟，还是钟塔？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 232.695,
      "end": 244.231,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "日常说法里，很多人用"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Big Ben"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "指整个著名地标；严格说，它最早指里面那口大钟。课文用的是大家熟悉的说法。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 244.58,
      "end": 251.983,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "B.B.C."
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Greenwich Observatory"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "为什么也在故事里？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 252.333,
      "end": 262.229,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "B.B.C."
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "把钟声传出去；Greenwich 让我们想到标准时间和官方检查。一个负责传播，一个代表准确。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 262.578,
      "end": 265.418,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后那个油漆桶为什么好笑？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 265.768,
      "end": 275.048,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为课文先用很多句子证明它又大、又准、又被检查、还能广播。结果呢？一个普通油漆桶挂在指针上，就让它慢了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 275.397,
      "end": 278.658,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以笑点是大系统遇到小细节？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 279.008,
      "end": 285.448,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Exactly. A famous accurate system can still be affected by one small human detail."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 285.798,
      "end": 289.438,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "如果学校的网络时间错了，也会这样吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 289.788,
      "end": 300.068,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "会。消息时间、线上课、运动会、车票、考试铃声，都需要 trusted time。公共时间一错，很多人都会被带偏。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 300.418,
      "end": 308.074,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "When you visit London, one of the first things you will see is Big Ben, the famous clock which can be heard all over the world on the B.B.C."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 308.423,
      "end": 315.047,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "If the Houses of Parliament had not been burned down in 1834, the great clock would never have been erected."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 315.397,
      "end": 323.293,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Big Ben takes its name from Sir Benjamin Hall who was responsible for the making of the clock when the new Houses of Parliament were being built."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 323.643,
      "end": 328.251,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It is not only of immense size, but is extremely accurate as well."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 328.601,
      "end": 333.065,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
