      "end": 482.254,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这叫 third conditional，但你先记住故事逻辑：过去已经发生了，句子在想象相反的过去。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 77,
